  /* feature projects: the 需求 page and the feature wording */
  "需求": "Requirements", "放进参考素材": "Add reference material", "去放参考素材": "Add reference material", "还没有放进参考素材。": "No reference material yet.", "图片": "Images", "认出的人": "People recognised",
  "放进参考素材：照片、视频、菜单、截图、文字说明都可以（txt / md / pdf / 图片 / 视频）。所有东西都留在这台电脑上。": "Add reference material: photos, videos, menus, screenshots and written notes are all fine (txt / md / pdf / images / video). Everything stays on this computer.",
  "下一步：看需求单": "Next: read the requirements", "你的资料只在这台电脑上": "Your material stays on this computer",
  "到这一步，没有任何东西离开过这台电脑。要把内容发给模型之前，会先告诉你发什么、发给谁，等你同意。": "Up to here, nothing has left this computer. Before anything is sent to a model, you will be told what is sent and to whom, and asked first.",
  "还没有需求单。在对话里告诉 agent 你想加什么（放在哪、怎么玩、素材从哪来），它会先问几个问题，再把需求写在这里给你确认。": "No requirements yet. Tell the agent in the chat what you want to add (where it goes, how it plays, where the material comes from). It will ask a few questions first, then write the requirements here for you to confirm.",
  "还没定的": "Still open", "要做的事": "What will be built", "{n} 条": "{n} items", "已定": "Settled", "待定": "Open", "怎么用": "How the player uses it", "怎样算做好": "How we know it works", "存档里会多什么": "What the save gets",
  "需求单里还没有条目，agent 还在问你问题。": "There are no items yet; the agent is still asking you questions.",
  "需求已确认": "Requirements confirmed", "需求都看完了？": "Read them all?", "确认需求": "Confirm requirements",
  "确认之后，agent 会按这份需求定方案、开工。之后还可以回来改。": "Once confirmed, the agent writes the plan from these requirements and starts building. You can come back and change them later.",
  "现在没有等你确认的方案。需求确认之后，agent 会把这个功能的方案写在这里。": "No plan is waiting for you. After you confirm the requirements, the agent writes this feature's plan here.",
  "做完之后，存档里会多的": "What your save gets once it is built",
  "比如在游戏里再来一次；具体对存档和卸载的影响，会在这一版做完、实际测过之后写在这里": "For example, doing it again in the game; the exact effect on your save and on uninstalling will be written here once this round is built and tested",
  "功能一直留在游戏里；对存档和卸载的影响，同样要实际测过之后才写明": "The feature stays in the game; its effect on your save and on uninstalling is also written only after real testing",
  "还没有可以试玩的东西。第一版做好之后会在这里。": "Nothing to play yet. The first round will appear here when it is built.",
  "参考": "Reference", "这一段没有可以对比的画面，请看录像": "This part has nothing to compare; watch the recording", "对这一段的意见": "Your note on this part", "这一段没有单独的检查项。": "This part has no checks of its own.",
  "已记下：{n} 段满意": "Noted: happy with {n} parts", "每一段你都表过态了": "You have given a verdict on every part",
  "把做好的功能装进你自己的游戏。装之前先备份你的存档，随时可以还原。": "Put the finished feature into your own game. Back up your saves first; you can restore them any time.",
  "收尾那一期，这里会找到你电脑上的游戏，并告诉你版本和是否装好了需要的组件。": "In the wrap-up round this finds the game on your computer and tells you its version and whether the needed components are installed.",
  "已有的进度不受影响；新功能会出现在方案里定的位置": "Your existing progress is untouched; the new feature appears where the plan puts it",
