  "管理员": "Admin", "退出登录": "Log out", "你还没有登录自己的 Claude 账号，agent 暂时不会回答你自己项目里的消息。请让管理员帮你登录一次。": "You have not logged in to your own Claude account yet, so the agent does not answer messages in your own projects for now. Ask the administrator to help you log in once.",
  "项目名": "Project name", "我的项目": "My projects", "还没有项目": "No projects yet",
  "共享给我的": "Shared with me", "其他人的项目": "Other people's projects", "权限只管这个网页里能做什么：服务器上大家都是同一个系统账号，能直接读写所有文件，这不是系统级的隔离。": "Access rights only control what this web page lets you do: everyone on the server uses the same system account and can read and write every file directly, so this is not system-level isolation.",
  "别人在你的项目里说话时，agent 用的是你的 Claude 登录和额度。": "When someone else writes in your project, the agent uses your Claude login and quota.", "想对所有者说一句（可选）": "A note for the owner (optional)", "所有者会在自己的对话里看到一张卡片，同意后你就有这个权限。你说的话由所有者的 Claude 额度回答。": "The owner sees a card in their own conversation; once they agree you have this access. Your messages are answered on the owner's Claude quota.",
  "发送申请": "Send request", "只读：申请评论或编辑权限后才能在这里说话": "Read only: ask for comment or edit access to write here", "你可以编辑这个项目": "You can edit this project",
