  "能在对话里说话、留意见，不能回答卡片或开工": "Can write in the conversation and leave notes; cannot answer cards or start builds", "能说话、回答卡片、开工和改设置；不能删项目、不能改成员": "Can write, answer cards, start builds and change settings; cannot delete the project or change members", "申请已发给所有者": "Request sent to the owner",
