  /* gameanything hub: 「我的 Claude」, passwords, 「用户管理」 */
  "我的 Claude": "My Claude", "用户管理": "Users", "改密码": "Change password", "项目": "Projects",
  "素材生成 API keys": "Asset generation API keys", "没有": "Not set", "已保存。": "Saved.",
  "也是 Codex 用的 OpenAI key：删掉它 Codex 的 API key 方式也会断开。": "This is also the OpenAI key Codex uses: removing it also disconnects Codex's API key option.",
  "画预览图、做 3D 模型和声音时用你自己的 key。agent 自己拿不到这些 key：只有你在许可卡上同意、在开工卡上点了开工以后，后台才会用它们生成，每次发送都记在隐私记录里。": "Preview pictures, 3D models and sounds are made with your own keys. The agent never gets these keys: only after you said yes on a permission card and pressed start on a go card does the background use them, and every send is written to the privacy record.",
  "删除这个 key？以后用它的生成会被拒绝，直到你重新保存。": "Remove this key? Generation that needs it will be refused until you save it again.",
  "我的 agent": "My agent", "你的 agent 还没连上：你的项目里 agent 暂时不会回复。去连接 →": "Your agent is not connected yet: the agent will not reply in your projects for now. Connect it →",
  "你项目里的 agent（回复你、做构建）用你自己的账号跑。选一个，再连接一次就行，以后不用再管。": "The agent in your projects (its replies and its builds) runs on your own account. Pick one and connect it once; that is all.",
  "用哪个：": "Which one:", "OpenAI API key（按用量计费）": "OpenAI API key (billed per use)", "你自己的 Codex / ChatGPT 登录": "Your own Codex / ChatGPT login",
  "方式一：Codex / ChatGPT 登录（用你的 ChatGPT 订阅额度）": "Option 1: Codex / ChatGPT login (your ChatGPT subscription quota)",
  "点下面的按钮，服务器会为你开始一次 Codex 登录：打开它给的链接，用你自己的 ChatGPT 账号登录，再输入页面上的一次性代码。登录只存在你自己的文件夹里。": "Click the button below and the server starts a Codex login for you: open the link it shows, sign in with your own ChatGPT account and enter the one-time code from this page. The login is kept only in your own folder.",
  "用 ChatGPT 登录 Codex": "Sign in to Codex with ChatGPT", "重新用 ChatGPT 登录": "Sign in again with ChatGPT", "也可以请管理员在服务器上运行：": "Or ask an administrator to run this on the server: ",
  "正在启动 Codex 登录…": "Starting the Codex login…", "打开这个链接（新标签页），用你自己的 ChatGPT 账号登录：": "Open this link (a new tab) and sign in with your own ChatGPT account:",
  "输入这个一次性代码：": "Enter this one-time code:", "（大约 {n} 分钟内有效）": " (valid for about {n} more minutes)",
  "登录好以后这一页会自己更新，不用再做别的。": "Once you are signed in, this page updates by itself; nothing else to do.",
  "只有你自己开始的这次登录才输入代码。别人发给你的代码不要输入。": "Only enter the code for a login you started yourself. Never enter a code someone sent you.",
  "Codex 已经用你的 ChatGPT 账号登录好了。点「测试连接」确认能用。": "Codex is now signed in with your ChatGPT account. Click “Test connection” to check that it works.",
  "登录没有完成（codex 退出了）。可以再试一次。": "The login did not finish (codex stopped). You can try again.", "一次性代码过期了（15 分钟）。可以再试一次。": "The one-time code expired (15 minutes). You can try again.",
  "已取消登录。": "Login cancelled.", "继续": "Continue", "重新登录会替换你现在的 Codex 登录。继续？": "Signing in again replaces your current Codex login. Continue?",
  "已登录": "Logged in", "还没登录": "Not logged in yet", "方式二：OpenAI API key（按用量计费）": "Option 2: OpenAI API key (billed per use)",
  "在 platform.openai.com 的 API keys 里新建一个 key（以 sk- 开头），粘贴到下面。按实际用量从你的 OpenAI 账户扣钱，不走订阅额度。": "Create a key under API keys on platform.openai.com (it starts with sk-) and paste it below. Usage is billed to your OpenAI account per use, not to a subscription.",
  "API key 按 token 计费：每次回复、每次构建都从你的账户扣钱。开工前，开工卡上会先写出这一期大约要多少钱和多久，你点了开工才会开始。": "An API key is billed per token: every reply and every build is charged to your account. Before a build, its start card shows about how much it will cost and how long it takes; nothing starts until you press start.",
  "连接正常：Codex 回复了": "Connected: Codex replied ",
  "模型服务的 API key（按 token 计费）": "A model provider's API key (billed per token)", "服务器上的 OpenCode 登录": "The OpenCode login on the server",
  "Gemini API key（按 token 计费）": "Gemini API key (billed per token)", "你自己的 Google 登录": "Your own Google login",
  "模型": "Model", "只改模型": "Save the model only", "模型已保存。": "Model saved.",
  "用一个模型服务的 API key（按 token 计费）": "An API key of a model provider (billed per token)",
  "OpenCode 能连 75 家以上的模型服务。最简单的是 OpenRouter：在 openrouter.ai/keys 新建一个 key（以 sk-or- 开头），粘贴到下面。一个 key 就能用很多家的模型，按实际用量从你的 OpenRouter 余额扣钱。": "OpenCode reaches more than 75 model providers. The simplest is OpenRouter: create a key at openrouter.ai/keys (it starts with sk-or-) and paste it below. One key works for models of many vendors; usage is charged to your OpenRouter balance.",
  "模型写成 provider/model。用 OpenRouter 时是 openrouter/ 加上 OpenRouter 网站上的模型名。别的服务也行（例如 anthropic/…、deepseek/…），粘贴那家的 key 就好。": "Write the model as provider/model. With OpenRouter it is openrouter/ followed by the model name on the OpenRouter site. Other providers work too (for example anthropic/… or deepseek/…): paste that provider's key.",
